# Voice AI Playground

Educational Python project exploring speech recognition, audio processing, YandexGPT and voice-controlled AI applications.

## About

This repository contains a collection of Python experiments developed while learning to work with speech technologies and AI APIs.

The project explores:

- Audio recording and processing
- Speech recognition experiments
- Sending requests to YandexGPT
- Context-aware AI conversations
- Voice-controlled interactions

## Project Status

**Educational / Experimental**

This is a learning project, not a production-ready application. Individual scripts represent different stages of experimentation and may require additional configuration.

## Technologies

- Python
- YandexGPT API
- Audio processing and speech technologies

## Security

API credentials are not intended to be included in this repository. Configure credentials locally before running scripts.